# Russian wording

The Russian adjective for "agent" / "agentic" is **агентный** (агентный режим, агентная сессия,
агентные инструменты). Never write **агентский**: it is the wrong word for this meaning. This applies
to everything written in Russian for this project: the `ru` dictionary under
`external/ui/src/ui/i18n/messages/`, Russian documentation and screenshots of the Russian interface,
commit messages, issue comments and answers to the operator. Before finishing a change that touches
Russian text, run `git grep -n -i 'агентск'` and expect no hits.
